# The house tracks the house. Projects keep their own history.
#
# Anything you put in projects/ is ignored here — clone a repository in, and it
# stays its own repository with its own remote and its own log, instead of being
# swallowed as an embedded checkout. The house commits what surrounds the work:
# tasks, decisions, knowledge, conventions, running context.
#
# To track a small project inside the house instead, un-ignore it explicitly:
#     !projects/scratchpad/
projects/*
!projects/README.md

# Installed instruments are artifacts, not authored source — iris is fetched
# by `amore init`, not written by you. Instruments you write yourself are
# tracked normally.
instruments/iris/

# Secrets never enter the tree, whatever a session may see.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
auth.json

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# Scratch and transient
tmp-*
*.tmp
*.log
